---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { LEGAL_UPDATED, mailto, OPERATOR } from '../data/site';
---

<Prose
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="NiftyFix processes your files on your device: they are never uploaded. What little data exists, who handles it, and your rights under Indian law."
  path="/privacy/"
  lede="Your files never leave your device. This page explains, item by item, the little data that does exist and what you can do about it."
  updated={LEGAL_UPDATED}
>
  <aside class="panel my-8 p-6">
    <p class="eyebrow">The short version</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 mb-0 grid list-none gap-3 pl-0 text-stone-800 sm:grid-cols-2 dark:text-stone-200">
      <li>✓ Files and text you use in a tool are processed in your browser and never uploaded.</li>
      <li>✓ No accounts, no sign-up, nothing to log in to.</li>
      <li>✓ No analytics, advertising or tracking scripts, and no cookies.</li>
      <li>✓ If you email us, we use your message only to reply.</li>
    </ul>
  </aside>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    NiftyFix (niftyfix.in) is run by {OPERATOR.name}, {OPERATOR.region}. For this policy, "we" means
    the operator of NiftyFix. You can reach us at <a href={mailto('Privacy')}>{OPERATOR.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
  <h3>Your files and anything you type into a tool: not collected</h3>
  <p>
    Every tool runs inside your browser, on a separate, sandboxed web address whose security rules
    block it from sending data anywhere. Photos, PDFs, signatures, file names and text you enter are
    read and processed on your device and are never sent to us or anyone else. You can{' '}
    <a href="/privacy-verification/">verify this yourself</a>.
  </p>
  <h3>Technical request data: handled by our hosting provider</h3>
  <p>
    Like every website, the pages and tool code are delivered to your browser over the internet. Our
    hosting and security provider, Cloudflare, processes the technical details of each request (such
    as your IP address, browser type and the page requested) to deliver the site and protect it from
    abuse. We do not use this data to track or profile you, and we do not run analytics on it. See{' '}
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
  <h3>Settings stored in your own browser</h3>
  <p>
    If you switch between light and dark mode, that choice is saved in your browser's local storage
    so the next page matches. It never leaves your device, and clearing your browser's site data
    removes it. Your browser may also cache the site's files to load faster next time.
  </p>
  <h3>Emails you send us</h3>
  <p>
    If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you choose to write. We use it only
    to reply and to fix the problem you report. Our email is provided by Google (Gmail). We delete
    support conversations once they are resolved, and in any case within 12 months, unless the law
    requires us to keep them longer. Please do not send us your documents: we never need them.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not sell, rent or trade personal data.</li>
    <li>We do not show advertising or use advertising or analytics trackers.</li>
    <li>We do not set cookies.</li>
    <li>We do not build profiles or make automated decisions about you.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If we ever add analytics or advertising, they will run only on the outer page, never inside the
    tools, and we will update this policy and ask for any consent the law requires before they
    start.
  </p>

  <h2>Who else handles data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Cloudflare, Inc. — hosting, content delivery and security for the website.</li>
    <li>Google LLC — our email inbox, only if you email us.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    These providers may process data outside India. We disclose information to authorities only when
    Indian law requires it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you can ask us to tell you what
    personal data we hold about you, to correct or complete it, and to erase it; you can withdraw
    any consent you have given, and you can nominate someone to exercise these rights for you. In
    practice, the only personal data we can hold is an email you sent us. Write to{' '}
    <a href={mailto('Privacy request')}>{OPERATOR.email}</a> and we will act on your request as soon
    as possible, and within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>Complaints (grievance officer)</h2>
  <p>
    Our grievance officer is {OPERATOR.name}, reachable at{' '}
    <a href={mailto('Grievance')}>{OPERATOR.email}</a>. We acknowledge complaints promptly and
    resolve them within 30 days. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may complain to the
    Data Protection Board of India.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    The tools can be used by anyone and collect nothing. If you are under 18 and need to contact us,
    please ask a parent or guardian to email us on your behalf.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served only over HTTPS, and each tool runs in an isolated, sandboxed frame. Details
    are on our <a href="/security/">security page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, we will update this page and the date at the top. Significant changes,
    such as starting to collect a new kind of data, will be announced on the site before they take
    effect.
  </p>
</Prose>
